# ttr: dialect=b lang=en
Load orders as o.
Compute priority as 1 when amount is bigger than 1000, otherwise 2.
Compute band as "A" when amount is bigger than 1000, "B" when amount is bigger than 100, otherwise "C".
Compute contact as "missing" when email is empty, otherwise email.
Compute flagged as true when note is not empty.
Compute amount * 2 as total.
